 -------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
 This is a log of changes that ncurses has gone through since Zeyd started
@@ -46,6 +46,15 @@
 Changes through 1.9.9e did not credit all contributions;
 it is not possible to add this information.
 
+20261017
+	+ improve configure script check for linker search path, avoiding cache
+	  rebuild on BSD systems (report by Showta Ishizaki).
+	+ when adding characters to a window, check if the position to be
+	  updated was part of a multicolumn character, clearing the whole
+	  multicolumn character in that case (report by Vassili Courzakis).
+	+ add fallback definitions for environment variables on non-multiuser
+	  systems (patch by Vassili Courzakis).
+
 20261010
 	+ modify test/test_mouse.c to demonstrate mouse_get(), mouse_test() and
 	  mouse_mask().
